WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:11.400
Welcome back to the arena for your final lesson.

00:11.400 --> 00:19.300
I want you to take a deep breath and a moment to acknowledge where you are.

00:19.300 --> 00:20.500
You made it.

00:20.500 --> 00:26.020
You stayed the course through a rigorous experience and you did the work.

00:26.020 --> 00:31.020
On behalf of myself and the entire Velvet Suite team, congratulations.

00:31.020 --> 00:32.820
You did it.

00:32.820 --> 00:35.500
Today is your victory lap.

00:35.500 --> 00:40.620
It's a moment to celebrate your progress, to consolidate the powerful lessons you've

00:40.620 --> 00:44.420
learned and to honor the leader you have become.

00:44.420 --> 00:50.700
But in the world of Athleadership, the final whistle of one season is also the starting

00:50.700 --> 00:53.020
pistol for the next.

00:53.020 --> 00:57.780
The work of a champion is never truly done, it just evolves.

00:57.780 --> 01:03.100
So this lesson is also about your post-season review.

01:03.100 --> 01:08.700
We will reflect on your journey, integrate your learning so they become a permanent part

01:08.700 --> 01:15.980
of your leadership DNA and create a clear plan for your next 90-day season.

01:15.980 --> 01:22.920
The A.R.A.W. focus today is on a full integration of all four of our pillars, preparing you

01:22.920 --> 01:26.400
to carry this momentum forward indefinitely.

01:26.400 --> 01:28.880
Let's take our final lap together.

